<title>UK: BAe wins 50 mln stg UK naval ammunition order.</title>
<headline>BAe wins 50 mln stg UK naval ammunition order.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Aerospace Plc said on Thursday its Royal Ordnance unit had won an order worth over 50 million pounds to develop new long range ammunition for the British navy's 4.5-inch Mark 8 guns.</p>
<p>It said the contract with the Ministry of Defence called for the design, development and production of the new ammunition.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
